{
  "title": "ISic002137. Epitaph for Soteres",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini, 2018-09-24</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[ἐν]ταῦθα τῖτε <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>𐆠 <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Σωτηρὴς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Σωτηρὴς\">Σωτηρὴς</span></span> γοινή <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἡρακλίωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἡρακλίωνος\">Ἡρακλίωνος</span></span> τοῦ <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>οἱποιατροῦ </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\">l.1 reg., orig. τ | l.3 reg., orig. οι | l.5 reg., orig. οἱπ</p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini, 2018-09-24</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[..]ΤΑΥΘΑΤΙΤΕ<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>𐆠<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Σωτηρὴς\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Σωτηρὴς\">ΣΩΤΗΡΗΣ</span></span>ΓΟΙΝΗ<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἡρακλίωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἡρακλίωνος\">ΗΡΑΚΛΙΩΝΟΣ</span></span>ΤΟΥ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΟΙΠΟΙΑΤΡΟΥ</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\">l.1 reg., orig. τ | l.3 reg., orig. οι | l.5 reg., orig. οἱπ</p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic002137_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-03\" src=\"ISic002137_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic002137.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-03\" src=\"ISic002137-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic002137_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-03\" src=\"ISic002137_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic002137_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-03\" src=\"ISic002137_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text based upon autopsy</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Here lies Soteres, wife of Heraklion the veterinarian</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The form of the name Soteres is probably for Soteris.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Ferrua 1989 no. 207 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001995</a></li><li> Cassia 2009-2012 171 no.25 </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Letters of somewhat irregular size and form. Alpha of cursive form, lunate epsilon and sigma, uncial omega, omicron of varying form.</p> Line 1-1  16-26  Line 3  14-27  Line 4  13-25  Line 5  11-29  Interlineation line 1 to 3  11-24  Interlineation line 3 to 4  6-20  Interlineation line 4 to 5  5-6  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
